    "image": "assets/photos/person-0.jpg",
    "bio": "Dr. Gan Zhao completed his PhD through joint training at Huazhong Agricultural University and the Andrew Vaughan laboratory at the University of Pennsylvania, followed by postdoctoral training in the Andrew Vaughan and Edward Morrisey laboratories. Selected for a national overseas high-level talent program, he joined the School of Medicine at Xiamen University in March 2025 and established his laboratory to study the cellular and molecular basis of lung injury and repair.",
    "bio_zh": "赵干博士在华中农业大学与宾夕法尼亚大学 Andrew Vaughan 团队联合培养完成博士学位，随后先后在 Andrew Vaughan 和 Edward Morrisey 团队完成博士后训练，入选国家海外高层次人才项目。2025年3月加入厦门大学医学院并成立课题组，聚焦肺损伤修复的细胞与分子基础研究。",
